   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Touch Me Pt 1**: back after 39 archived shows (1067 days); rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Big Decisions**: rare: 11 archived performances [6]\n- **At Dawn**: back after 22 archived shows (754 days) [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2015-07-29.NSL** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 132 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer notes the recording captured the lead vocals clearly despite initial concerns [5]\n- **mmj2015-07-29.dpa4022.flacf16**: source not stated; 20 songs; 133 min [3]\n- **mmj2015-07-29._TDS**: source not stated; 20 songs; 133 min [4]\n- **mmj2015-07-29.dpa4022.flacf24**: source not stated; 20 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2015-07-29.NSL**: taped by NSL; transferred by NSL; source: Berliner CM-33's > Naiant Littlebox > Sony PCM-M10 (24/48) [1]\n- **mmj2015-07-29.dpa4022.flacf16**: taped by Brian Hadella; transferred by Brian Hadella; source: DPA 4022 (FOB, Section 2, Row 7, Seats 7 and 8, 6.5' up, DIN) > Sonosax SX-M2 > Sound Devices USBPre 2 > Edirol R44 (24/48) [3]\n- **mmj2015-07-29._TDS**: taped by Marty Loving; transferred by Marty Loving; source: Source: Beyer CK950(DIN) + AKG480 > Tascam DR-680 @ 24/48 [4]. Also: Marty Loving recorded and transferred the audio using Beyer and AKG microphones [4]\n- **mmj2015-07-29.dpa4022.flacf24**: source: DPA 4022 (FOB, Section 2, Row 7, Seats 7 and 8, 6.5' up, DIN) > Sonosax SX-M2 > Sound Devices USBPre 2 > Edirol R44 (24/48) [2]",
